 "remarks": "Welcome to 300 Broad Street, Unit 203! This beautifully maintained condo offers the perfect blend of comfort and convenience. Enjoy plenty of natural light pouring through the windows, hardwood floors, a modern kitchen with granite countertops, recessed lighting, ample closet space, and an in-unit washer and dryer. Residents enjoy great amenities, including a fitness center, outdoor courtyard with grills and seating, and assigned garage parking. Whether you're a first-time buyer or looking to downsize, this condo is a great place to call home. Conveniently located close to Downtown Stamford, restaurants, shopping, nightlife, and the Metro-North train station. A fantastic location with everything you need just minutes away! Schedule your private showing today!",
